WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.910
Today is the middle sound. It is the one children leave out most.

2
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:11.172
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.672 --> 00:00:14.251
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:14.751 --> 00:00:18.233
There are five middle sounds in this plan. Listen to each one.

5
00:00:24.165 --> 00:00:28.329
You can play them again whenever you like, on the page where these videos are.

6
00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:31.680
Now watch what the middle sound does. This is hat.

7
00:00:35.982 --> 00:00:38.549
And this is hut. Only the middle changes.

8
00:00:42.598 --> 00:00:49.038
Your child taps the three boxes, stops on the middle one, and writes its letter. Then reads the word back.

9
00:00:49.488 --> 00:00:55.525
If a middle sound is hard to hear, do not say the answer. Play the five sounds, and let your child pick.

10
00:00:55.975 --> 00:01:00.618
Do job one together. Name the pictures in job two. Then step away.

11
00:01:01.068 --> 00:01:05.210
At the end, your child taps and says the sounds of three pictures for you.
